WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.470
Team Q4 versus FFBS!

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:07.290
Which of them is the 
strongest team in C Block?!

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:09.400
...Guess it can't be helped.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.840
And his opponent from Q4 is also here!

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.010
B-Brother!

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:17.020
Why?!

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:20.130
I rested up a bit.

00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:22.160
I'm all right now.

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:26.000
But I guess I'm a little 
disappointed in you two.

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:30.830
Without me out here, Q4 can't win.

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:37.340
I was convinced you'd run away.

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:41.660
Oh, please. There's no need for me 
to be afraid of someone like you.

00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:47.720
I'm... stronger... than anyone!

00:02:26.390 --> 00:02:29.160
Aichi Sendou is the third fighter?

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:31.750
They saved the weakest for last?

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:41.490
Aichi!

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:47.860
Aichi really needs to be 
resting! What should I do?

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:48.560
Misaki!

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:53.870
Kamui...

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:03.820
Solitary Fight

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:06.980
Aichi Sendou of Team Q4

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:09.410
versus Kiriya Bidou of Team BS!

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:14.640
Bidou is so dreamy!

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:16.360
Bidou!

00:03:16.510 --> 00:03:19.370
Enjoy a glorious win against 
that dull-looking boy!

00:03:19.610 --> 00:03:21.710
What's with all the Bidou love?

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:23.910
He's just a smug, scrawny jerk!

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:26.400
...is what <i>he</i> said!

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:27.480
Me?!

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:29.630
I'm sorry!

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:34.190
Could a guy like this really have 
mastered the Shadow Paladin deck?

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:38.060
I'll beat you right in front of Ren!

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:41.250
Ren...

00:03:41.790 --> 00:03:47.030
If Bidou wins this fight, are you going 
to give him the vacant spot on AL4?

00:03:47.510 --> 00:03:50.550
Only if he satisfies me.

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:54.580
If he satisfies me...

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:08.630
And now, the third match. Begin!

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:11.460
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:21.370
Fullbau!

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:23.450
Hades Ringmaster!

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:25.650
I go first.

00:04:25.980 --> 00:04:26.800
Draw!

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:29.290
I ride Skull Juggler.

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:34.460
Then I use the skill of the 
Hades Ringmaster to Soulcharge.

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:39.710
On top of that, I use Skull Juggler's 
skill to send one more card to the Soul.

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:42.120
That's the end of my turn.

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:43.680
It's my turn.

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:44.540
I draw.

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:47.450
I ride Blaster Javelin.

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:53.050
I activate Fullbau's skill.

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:54.930
When I ride Blaster Javelin on this unit,

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:58.660
I can take Blaster Dark from 
my deck and add it to my hand.

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:04.740
Fullbau is in the Soul, so 
Javelin gains +2000 power.

00:05:05.140 --> 00:05:07.240
I call Black Sage, Charon.

00:05:08.380 --> 00:05:11.000
I attack Skull Juggler with Charon!

00:05:16.390 --> 00:05:17.770
Damage check.

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:19.950
Heal trigger.

00:05:19.950 --> 00:05:22.430
I add +5000 to the power of Skull Juggler.

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:26.270
Blaster Javelin attacks.

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:29.420
Drive check.

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:31.720
That's the end of my turn.

00:05:32.050 --> 00:05:33.680
I stand and draw.

00:05:34.650 --> 00:05:36.120
I ride Elephant Juggler!

00:05:49.710 --> 00:05:52.700
I call Barking Cerberus and Midnight Bunny!

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:57.460
Elephant Juggler's skill...

00:05:57.890 --> 00:05:59.210
Soulcharge.

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:01.600
I attack Blaster Javelin!

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:08.150
Drive check.

00:06:11.420 --> 00:06:12.930
Damage check.

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:17.740
Cerberus attacks with a boost from Bunny!

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:22.330
Trigger check.

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:23.830
I got draw trigger.

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:26.500
Naturally, I give the power to Javelin.

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:32.760
Midnight Bunny's Counterblast!

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:38.790
If the attack she boosted hits, she trades 
places with a unit that's in the Soul.

00:06:39.270 --> 00:06:41.500
I call Nightmare Doll Alice!

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:55.330
When Alice appears, I can Soulcharge again.

00:06:55.730 --> 00:06:57.120
Go, Alice!

00:06:58.520 --> 00:06:59.980
Attack Charon!

00:07:03.170 --> 00:07:06.310
I guard with Witch of Nostrum, Arianrhod!

00:07:14.770 --> 00:07:15.810
That's the end of my turn.

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:18.970
They're still at the stage where 
their Vanguards are grade 2...

00:07:18.970 --> 00:07:22.240
Calling grade 3s from the Soul to attack?

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:24.080
This is interesting, isn't it?

00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:27.570
There you go! Take out more grade 3s!

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:28.780
Morikawa!

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:31.570
Bidou!

00:07:31.570 --> 00:07:34.350
You're such a handsome technician!

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:35.920
Look over here!

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:43.660
Bidou...?

00:07:43.660 --> 00:07:46.130
He always waves and answers us...

00:07:46.670 --> 00:07:48.370
I stand and draw.

00:07:50.510 --> 00:07:52.390
It seems you have a strong dislike for me.

00:07:54.510 --> 00:07:59.620
Why is that? I think I have the right to 
ask, as I've never done anything to you.

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:01.660
I can't get it out of my head.

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:04.350
Why did Ren give <i>you</i> that deck?

00:08:05.470 --> 00:08:06.880
What's so funny?!

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:10.800
Well, of course, the reason 
is that I'm strong.

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:13.650
Not in my book!

00:08:14.100 --> 00:08:15.220
You are not strong in my book!

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:19.140
Today, right here in front of Ren, 
I'm going to teach you that lesson!

00:08:19.980 --> 00:08:21.850
I wonder which of us will 
really be the teacher...

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:24.830
Where there is light, there is darkness.

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:29.710
Light can only be swallowed up by darkness...

00:08:29.710 --> 00:08:31.680
Appear from the everlasting darkness...

00:08:32.350 --> 00:08:34.150
Dark Spirit...

00:08:34.560 --> 00:08:36.120
Blaster Dark!

00:08:49.270 --> 00:08:50.320
Brother...

00:08:53.270 --> 00:08:55.290
It doesn't seem like that kid at all!

00:08:55.750 --> 00:08:58.150
Boys sure do change, don't they?

00:08:58.150 --> 00:08:59.130
Right, Kourin?

00:08:59.420 --> 00:09:00.570
Kourin...?

00:09:07.990 --> 00:09:09.010
Aichi...

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:26.930
I've got a Blaster Javelin in the Soul, 
so +1000 is added to Blaster Dark's power.

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:29.270
I move Charon.

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:32.740
And then I call Skull Witch, Nemain.

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:35.520
Nemain's Counterblast.

00:09:35.990 --> 00:09:38.170
I discard one Shadow Paladin

00:09:38.690 --> 00:09:40.560
and draw two cards from my deck.

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:43.840
I call Knight of Darkness, Rugos.

00:09:46.630 --> 00:09:48.220
Rugos attacks!

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:54.270
I guard with Rainbow Magician!

00:09:59.010 --> 00:10:01.010
Go forth, Blaster Dark!

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:04.120
Drive check!

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:06.370
I got a heal trigger.

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:09.330
I add +5000 to the power of Nemain.

00:10:09.930 --> 00:10:11.860
And I heal 1 point.

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:17.720
Damage check!

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:22.660
With a boost from Charon, Nemain attacks!

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:39.770
He deals damage to his opponent 
while healing himself.

00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:43.360
Aichi Sendou has launched a 
smooth <i>oh</i>-ffensive, hasn't he?

00:10:43.850 --> 00:10:45.520
I stand and draw!

00:10:47.360 --> 00:10:50.310
I ride Dusk Illusionist, Robert!

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:58.610
I activate Robert's skill!

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:00.470
Soulcharge!

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:04.330
I look at the top card of my 
deck... and leave it there.

00:11:06.450 --> 00:11:08.500
Everything is ready for the show!

00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:11.520
Alice! Attack Nemain!

00:11:22.440 --> 00:11:23.700
Counterblast!

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:25.870
I move Alice to the Soul...

00:11:26.880 --> 00:11:29.090
...and call Bunny from the Soul!

00:11:32.110 --> 00:11:33.860
Robert attacks!

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:36.050
No guard.

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:39.580
Twin drive, first check.

00:11:40.240 --> 00:11:41.410
Draw trigger.

00:11:42.160 --> 00:11:44.520
I add +5000 to the power of Cerberus!

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:46.050
Second check!

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:54.990
With a boost from Bunny...

00:11:56.960 --> 00:11:58.570
...Cerberus attacks!

00:11:58.570 --> 00:11:59.970
No guard.

00:12:04.260 --> 00:12:06.290
Bunny's Counterblast.

00:12:06.860 --> 00:12:08.770
I move Bunny to the Soul.

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:10.220
And from the Soul...

00:12:11.020 --> 00:12:12.530
...I call Alice!

00:12:14.610 --> 00:12:16.210
Alice attacks!

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:19.310
No guard.

00:12:26.650 --> 00:12:31.090
From Alice to Bunny and Bunny 
to Alice! It's just like magic!

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:33.110
It's showtime, indeed!

00:12:33.110 --> 00:12:38.080
Uh oh! Aichi Sendou's damage 
has increased dramatically!

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:42.490
Go! Go! Bidou!

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:46.430
Come on, Aichi! What's with the "no guard"?!

00:12:46.430 --> 00:12:48.760
Quit trying to look cool!

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:51.890
It doesn't look like he's 
thinking about the cost...

00:12:51.890 --> 00:12:54.140
Fine, whatever. I think he's out of options.

00:12:54.900 --> 00:12:56.080
Cat...

00:12:56.490 --> 00:12:57.440
Where?

00:12:57.440 --> 00:13:04.210
No, when a cat knows a mouse can't get away, 
it lets it do what it wants for a while.

00:13:04.210 --> 00:13:05.020
Huh?

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:10.250
I stand and draw.

00:13:11.250 --> 00:13:14.270
I ride Phantom Blaster Dragon!

00:13:24.050 --> 00:13:26.660
When Blaster Dark is in the Soul,

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:28.810
+1000 is added to this unit's power.

00:13:32.980 --> 00:13:35.810
I call Dark Mage, Badhabh Caar.

00:13:38.950 --> 00:13:40.480
Badhabh Caar's  skill...

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:43.940
If the top card of my deck 
is a Shadow Paladin...

00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:46.680
...I can call that unit.

00:13:47.020 --> 00:13:51.660
And with the skill of the Badhabh Carr that 
I just called, I call one more unit.

00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:56.130
And then...

00:13:56.330 --> 00:13:59.140
Phantom Blaster Dragon, Counterblast!

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:10.080
In exchange for three units,

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:15.000
+10000 is added to the power of 
Phantom Blaster Dragon for this turn.

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:17.100
Critical +1!

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:26.290
I call Blaster Dark and Arianrhod!

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:33.850
Rugos attacks Cerberus!

00:14:40.210 --> 00:14:41.930
I guard with Spiral Master!

00:14:46.980 --> 00:14:49.370
With a boost from Arianrhod,

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:51.910
Phantom Blaster Dragon attacks!

00:14:52.750 --> 00:14:54.950
That's 28000 power!

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:57.660
Can Bidou defend against it?!

00:14:58.670 --> 00:15:01.740
Is that the last trick you know?

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:08.290
I pay the cost to activate 
Hades Hypnotist's skill...

00:15:08.610 --> 00:15:12.660
Hades Hypnotist! That 
attack won't go through!

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:15.040
Bidou is so cool!

00:15:16.490 --> 00:15:20.070
Impressive. You know this deck well...

00:15:21.470 --> 00:15:24.680
I won't guard against your next 
attack... What are you going to do?

00:15:25.510 --> 00:15:27.350
Thank you.

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:29.800
With a boost from Charon...

00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:33.140
...Blaster Dark attacks!

00:15:40.450 --> 00:15:46.080
In the end, you just don't have the 
same power with that deck as Ren.

00:15:46.620 --> 00:15:49.640
That's called being out of your depth.

00:15:56.650 --> 00:15:59.320
Ren is watching me!

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:02.470
I'll end it right here!

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:04.720
Final Turn!

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:07.100
There it is! "Final Turn!"

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:13.040
Dreamy!

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:14.540
Cool!

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:19.800
Please watch my beautiful finale...

00:16:19.800 --> 00:16:25.690
And as a curtain call, Ren, please give 
me that bouquet of a place with AL4!

00:16:26.820 --> 00:16:28.130
I stand and draw!

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:33.470
With Robert's skill, I Soulcharge 
the top card of my deck!

00:16:34.460 --> 00:16:36.510
I call Bicorn and Bunny!

00:16:37.650 --> 00:16:39.880
With a boost from Bicorn, Alice attacks!

00:16:44.620 --> 00:16:47.190
I guard with Darkside Trumpeter!

00:16:57.820 --> 00:16:59.910
You don't know when to quit!

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:01.580
With a boost from Bunny,

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:02.620
here I come!

00:17:04.630 --> 00:17:06.140
I'm going to win this...

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.410
Aichi Sendou!

00:17:10.570 --> 00:17:11.710
Grim Reaper...

00:17:15.940 --> 00:17:19.300
...and Blaster Dark... intercept.

00:17:25.220 --> 00:17:26.380
Darn it!

00:17:28.600 --> 00:17:30.040
I don't believe it!

00:17:30.590 --> 00:17:31.630
Yes!!

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:33.260
His "Final Turn" failed!

00:17:33.560 --> 00:17:35.010
Lame!

00:17:35.010 --> 00:17:38.390
You're always full of 
energy when you criticize!

00:17:38.390 --> 00:17:39.840
Well, sure!

00:17:41.940 --> 00:17:44.930
I thought that would be a 
little more fun than it was...

00:17:46.690 --> 00:17:48.860
...but it was just a boring trick.

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:50.400
Why, you...!

00:17:50.730 --> 00:17:53.180
Ren is watching this...

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:03.450
R-Ren...

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:08.260
Cerberus, attack Rugos!

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:17.630
It's fine... It'll be fine! If I can 
just get through the next turn...

00:18:17.630 --> 00:18:19.740
I can't afford to lose in front of Ren!

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:22.000
Th-That's the end of my turn...

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:26.820
Kai... Kai is watching me from 
somewhere, too, isn't he?

00:18:28.280 --> 00:18:31.380
I'll show you how strong I am!

00:18:32.950 --> 00:18:34.400
Final Turn!

00:18:35.720 --> 00:18:39.280
Oh, my! Aichi Sendou has 
also announced "Final Turn!"

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:40.300
He did!

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:42.800
Idiot! What are you gonna 
do if <i>you</i> lose face?!

00:18:43.650 --> 00:18:45.480
I stand and draw.

00:18:46.970 --> 00:18:50.800
I call Grim Reaper and Abyss Healer.

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:52.720
Counterblast.

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:55.010
Phantom Blaster Dragon!

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:06.080
D-Don't!

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:10.360
I add +10000 to the power 
of Phantom Blaster Dragon

00:19:10.360 --> 00:19:12.730
and give him the extra critical.

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:16.160
I've become stronger, haven't I?

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:19.320
But I'm still not there, am I?

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:22.410
I have to become even stronger...

00:19:23.070 --> 00:19:26.310
...or you won't give me recognition.

00:19:27.120 --> 00:19:29.390
Dark Metal Dragon, attack...

00:19:29.590 --> 00:19:30.810
...Cerberus!

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:35.870
Don't! Don't do it!

00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:39.690
I don't want Ren to see me 
humiliated like this! Please!

00:19:40.870 --> 00:19:42.720
I have to get stronger.

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:48.750
I have to get stronger... 
I have to get stronger...

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:50.800
More... More!

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:53.110
No, don't!!

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:55.410
I'm gonna get stronger!

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:58.150
With a boost from Arian,

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:01.410
Phantom Blaster Dragon attacks!

00:20:56.850 --> 00:21:00.120
T-The winner is Aichi Sendou!

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:03.560
Team Q4 is first place 
in the elimination round!

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:06.710
That was uncool...

00:21:06.710 --> 00:21:08.800
Bidou is a dork.

00:21:08.800 --> 00:21:11.970
Aichi is cooler than him. I mean...

00:21:11.970 --> 00:21:13.510
Aichi is better, isn't he?!

00:21:14.050 --> 00:21:15.750
Women...

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:18.240
Hey, that is Aichi, isn't it?

00:21:25.900 --> 00:21:27.990
Welcome, Aichi.

00:21:27.990 --> 00:21:30.180
And too bad for you, Kai.

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:32.330
As for his opponent...

00:21:32.330 --> 00:21:34.460
Huh? Who was it again?

00:21:34.850 --> 00:21:35.880
Well, it doesn't matter.

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:40.450
This kid is amazing! It's like 
he's another person entirely!

00:21:40.450 --> 00:21:41.260
Kourin?

00:21:51.920 --> 00:21:54.820
Somebody, stop him fast.

00:21:54.820 --> 00:21:56.110
Stop that kid...

00:21:56.790 --> 00:21:58.920
That was a crushing victory, Sendou.

00:21:58.920 --> 00:22:01.510
Who's the one that said he was the weakest?

00:22:01.740 --> 00:22:03.700
Next time, I'm gonna get his autograph!

00:22:03.700 --> 00:22:06.400
Y'know, the guy's never made much 
of an impression on me before,

00:22:06.400 --> 00:22:08.490
but was Sendou always like that?

00:22:08.490 --> 00:22:11.870
Aichi, I swear I'll stop you...

00:23:51.080 --> 00:23:55.590
That Kiriya Bidou was a candidate 
to be the next member of AL4!

00:23:55.590 --> 00:23:58.650
He was a stronger fighter 
than Kyou Yahagi, wasn't he?

00:23:58.650 --> 00:24:02.450
To be honest, I thought it was gonna be a 
hard fight, but it was an overwhelming victory!

00:24:02.450 --> 00:24:04.230
Kai, are you watching?

00:24:04.230 --> 00:24:09.160
The way I am now, I might be able to 
beat Team Caesar... maybe even Ren...

00:24:09.160 --> 00:24:11.500
Next time: Kai's Battle.

00:24:11.500 --> 00:24:13.920
There's an interval before the finals, huh?

00:24:13.920 --> 00:24:15.790
I haven't gotten in nearly enough fighting...

